    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Confidentiality Agreement</i> is a four-chapter visual novel. Faced with choices that have no clear answers, you must prove yourself as a counselor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You keep telling yourself:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u25a2 My rapport with the client is solid.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u25a2 My stress level is stable.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u25a2 I can save the client.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u25a2 I have failed to save a client.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u25a2 I should never have become a counselor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The client is calling for you.</strong></p>",
